</h5><p>A wry comment on the general refusal of working-class men and the trade union movement to consider women’s maintenance of the household as work.</p><p class="source"><strong>Source:</strong> J. S. Pughe, <em>Puck</em>, 1900—Prints and Photographs Division,&nbsp;Library of Congress.
